 and reaches toward the cat. The young woman with a soft, sleepy and affectionate voice (S1) looks at the cat and says: <d>[Chinese] 早安呀，小黑白，你又比我早醒呀！</d> From 00:07.800 to 00:09.000, she lifts the cat into her arms, and the cat presses its cheek against her chin while resting its front paws on her pink pajama top. During the final second, the woman settles against the headboard while holding the relaxed cat, and the gray toy mouse remains visible beside them on the bed. The woman, cat, clothing, bedding, lighting, camera angle, spatial relationships and overall composition converge precisely to Picture 2 at the 10.00-second mark.\n\noverall_soundscape: A quiet bedroom ambience continues beneath soft breathing and distant morning city sounds. The cat's paws make gentle sounds on the blanket, followed by a soft fabric rustle as it jumps onto the bed and places the gray toy mouse down. The bedding shifts as the woman wakes and lifts the cat, while the cat produces a quiet continuous purr during the embrace.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A", 416, 768, 243], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 233, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 234, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "link": 254, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "link": 255, "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 256, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 257, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "length"}, "name": "length", "link": 239, "label": "length", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "length"}], "flags": {}, "ty